# Enterprise BPM Portal Architecture

## Stack
- FastAPI
- Jinja2
- HTMX
- Bootstrap 5
- PostgreSQL
- CIBSeven (Or Any Camunda7 Forked Engines) REST API
- Keycloak
- Internationalization (Arabic/English)

## Principle
CIBSeven (Or Any Camunda 7 Forked Engines) is the workflow engine.
The portal is the business application.

## Responsibilities
### Portal
- Request creation
- Task inbox
- Search
- Reporting
- Attachments
- Dashboards

### CIBSeven (or Any Camunda 7 Forked Engines)
- Workflow orchestration
- Timers
- Escalations
- Task assignment
- Process history
